  "status": "Refused",
  "description": "Change of use from a 4 Bed domestic residence (C3a) to a 4 bed children’s home (C2).",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposed development results in the loss of a family-sized dwellinghouse, the need for which is clearly demonstrated in the development plan and supporting evidence base. Furthermore, the applicant fails to accurately demonstrate that there&amp;nbsp;is an identified need for the children&#x27;s home,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;which&amp;nbsp;would not meet the current needs of LBBD Children’s Social Care, according to&amp;nbsp;LBBD&#x27;s Lead Commissioner in Children&#x27;s Social Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;. As such, the proposal is considered to have a detrimental impact on the borough&#x27;s supply of family housing and is contrary to the following policies:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (December 2024) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;Policiy&amp;nbsp;D7, H1, H12 and S2 of the London Plan (March 2021) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;Policies SP3 and&amp;nbsp;SPDG1 of the Barking and Dagenham Local Plan 2037 (September 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The applicant&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;has failed to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;confirm the presence of a lawful vehicle crossover or apply for one through the appropriate highways process,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;and has failed to provide sufficient evidence that the proposal will not result in unacceptable levels of parking stress in the vicinity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;As such, it fails to comply with the following policies::&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (December 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;Policies T1, T2, T4, T6 and T6.1 of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;Policy DMT2 of the Barking and Dagenham Local Plan 2037 (September 2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;"
  ],
